────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DEGENFEED WEB — AI Agent Guardrails
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## Monorepo Rules
- Use `pnpm --filter` for package-scoped commands, never cd into subdirs
- Turborepo pipeline enforces build order — don't bypass with raw commands
- Workspace packages use `workspace:*` protocol — never add external deps to packages

## Protocol SDK Rules
- Each SDK (`nostr-sdk`, `farcaster-sdk`, etc.) is self-contained
- SDKs share types from `@degenfeed/types`
- SDKs never import from `apps/web` (apps import from SDKs, not vice versa)

## Biome Rules
- All 30 a11y rules enforced — no exceptions
- Globals.css is excluded from linting (by override)
- Single quotes, semicolons, trailing commas mandated

## Cloudflare-Specific
- Workers run on Cloudflare Workers (not Node.js)
- No `fs`, no `path`, no Node.js builtins in worker code
- Wrangler is the deployment tool — never deploy via raw curl/API

## UI Component Rules
- Components in `@degenfeed/ui` are shared across apps
- Tailwind classes only — no custom CSS files (except globals.css)
- dompurify sanitize all user-generated HTML
- Wallet sign-in uses `@degenfeed/auth`, never raw wallet adapter
